{"slug":"world-racing-2","title":"World Racing 2","desc":"PC, Synetic 2005 (Steam, with DLC1)","notes":["Read with a Python port of the formats in Kromster's MTKit2 sources (github.com/Kromster80/wr_toolkit): MOX models, MTL materials, PTX pictures (DXT or BGRA, LZSS packed).  100 cars: the 91 of the game (Autos) and the 9 of the DLC (DLC1/Autos) in the folder _DLC1.  Folder names are the game's folder names; the _evo_NN folders are the tuned versions that the game keeps as models of their own.","A car is one model with its parts at rest: the body with cabin, engine bay, glass and lamps (Body); the parts that open or come off in crashes (bonnet, boot, doors, bumpers, wings, mirrors, exhausts, damage pieces) and the suspension of every wheel (wishbones, upright, spring, brake disc and caliper: the parts A/B/C/D/L<VL|VR|HL|HR>_) (Parts); and the 4 wheels of the car (each modelled for its side) on the brake parts (Wheels).","Number plates: the cars carry US and EU plates at the same place; the EU plates are shown, the US plates are hidden (Variants/plates_us).","The game uses left-handed axes in decimetres: mirrored into right-handed ones in metres (badges and texts read the right way).","Paint: the materials whose colour changes with the paint set of the game (up to 20 per car) are painted one red here, like the other games; the rest keep the game's colour (Diffuse x 2, as its shaders do).  Pictures that the game lays over a colour are flattened onto it; glass is see-through (1 - Transparency of the material).  Left out: the lamp glow records, the driver, the collision models. _Rims: the rims of the tuning shop (3DFelgen Style_NN, the DLC ones as DLC1_Style_NN) and the stock wheel of every car (stock_<car>), with their tyres, the front left wheel of each, outer face towards +X; _rims.csv names the files that are the same model as another one. _Traffic: the 31 traffic vehicles (vans, buses, lorries, taxis, ambulances, police) with their wheels placed from the #REIF line of their text file (track, axle positions, radius)."],"tags":["world-racing-2"],"sections":[{"key":"cars","label":"Cars","items":[["280sl","",1517707,"world-racing-2","car-280sl.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-280sl.webp"],["280sl_evo_01","",1621040,"world-racing-2","car-280sl_evo_01.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-280sl_evo_01.webp"],["300se","",2426997,"world-racing-2","car-300se.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-300se.webp"],["300se_evo_01","",2966095,"world-racing-2","car-300se_evo_01.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-300se_evo_01.webp"],["300sl","",1781487,"world-racing-2","car-300sl.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-300sl.webp"],["300sl_evo_01","",2148350,"world-racing-2","car-300sl_evo_01.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-300sl_evo_01.webp"],["300sls","",2240956,"world-racing-2","car-300sls.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-300sls.webp"],["33tt12c","",3519845,"world-racing-2","car-33tt12c.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-33tt12c.webp"],["450slc","",4719875,"world-racing-2","car-450slc.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-450slc.webp"],["450slc_evo_01","",6303113,"world-racing-2","car-450slc_evo_01.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-450slc_evo_01.webp"],["450slc_evo_02","",3645932,"world-racing-2","car-450slc_evo_02.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-450slc_evo_02.webp"],["accobra","",2055790,"world-racing-2","car-accobra.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-accobra.webp"],["accobra_evo_01","",2237201,"world-racing-2","car-accobra_evo_01.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-accobra_evo_01.webp"],["aero8","",1926203,"world-racing-2","car-aero8.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-aero8.webp"],["aero8_gtn","",2235707,"world-racing-2","car-aero8_gtn.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-aero8_gtn.webp"],["alfa147","",3690527,"world-racing-2","car-alfa147.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-alfa147.webp"],["alfa147cup","",2646245,"world-racing-2","car-alfa147cup.zip","thumbs/world-racing-2/cars/car-alfa147cup.webp"],["alfa147zyte